        "comment_zh": "博通展現了卓越的營運效率與資本回報能力。其高達38.4%的ROE和20.3%的ROA，以及完美的9/9皮氏F-Score，均證明了公司在資產運用和盈利能力上的強勁表現。博通透過精準的併購策略，整合被收購資產，優化產品組合，並嚴格控制成本，將業務重心放在高毛利、高現金流的基礎設施解決方案上，從而實現了持續遠超WACC的ROIC，為股東創造了可觀的複利價值。",
        "comment_en": "Broadcom demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency and capital returns. Its high ROE of 38.4% and ROA of 20.3%, along with a perfect 9/9 Piotroski F-Score, attest to the company's strong performance in asset utilization and profitability. Through precise M&A strategies, Broadcom integrates acquired assets, optimizes product portfolios, and rigorously controls costs, focusing on high-margin, high-cash-flow infrastructure solutions. This consistently achieves ROIC far exceeding WACC, creating substantial compounding value for shareholders."
