        "comment_zh": "Tyler Technologies 的核心護城河之一是其極高的轉換成本。政府機構一旦採用其軟體系統，如稅務管理、法院記錄或公共安全調度，這些系統便深度整合到日常運營的每一個環節。更換供應商不僅意味著巨額的數據遷移費用、員工再培訓成本，更可能導致關鍵服務中斷，帶來無法承受的政治與社會風險。這種轉換的複雜性與高昂代價，使得客戶對TYL的服務產生極強的黏性，是其最堅固的商業壁壘。",
        "comment_en": "One of Tyler Technologies' core moats is its extremely high switching costs. Once government agencies adopt its software systems, such as for tax administration, court records, or public safety dispatch, these systems become deeply integrated into every aspect of daily operations. Changing vendors not only entails massive data migration expenses and employee retraining costs but also risks disrupting critical services, leading to unbearable political and social repercussions. The complexity and high price of such a transition create immense stickiness for TYL's services among its clientele, representing its most robust business barrier."
