        "comment_en": "While Tyler Technologies' network effect isn't as direct as social media, it still holds significant sway within the government software sector. As more local governments adopt its platforms, the company gathers diverse needs and feedback from a broad user base, enabling it to optimize product features and enhance the universality and efficiency of its solutions. Furthermore, a large installed base attracts third-party developers and partners, collectively building a richer application ecosystem that adds value for all participants. This indirect network effect strengthens its market position."
