        "comment_en": "Tyler Technologies enjoys a significant scale advantage in the government software sector. Developing complex software systems that meet stringent government requirements and offer extensive functionality entails substantial upfront R&D investment. However, once the core product is developed, the marginal cost of deploying it to additional government agencies is relatively low. The company's large customer base allows it to amortize R&D expenses over a greater volume of licenses and service revenues, achieving lower unit costs than smaller competitors. This scale effect enhances its cost competitiveness in delivering comprehensive solutions and boosts profitability."
