        "comment_en": "Tyler Technologies exhibits characteristics of an efficient scale moat within the niche government software market. Many local government software needs are highly specialized and the market size is relatively limited, insufficient to profitably support numerous competitors simultaneously. In this 'efficient scale' market structure, TYL, with its deep expertise cultivated over many years and extensive customer base, has become one of the few dominant suppliers. New entrants not only face high R&D costs but also must overcome the complexities of government procurement and client trust in existing vendors, naturally leading the market towards an oligopoly."
