        "comment_en": "Tyler Technologies' core strategic assets possess extremely high irreproducibility. Even if a competitor had a hundred billion dollars, it would be challenging to replicate within a few years the deep relationships built with thousands of government agencies, the decades of accumulated specialized domain expertise, and the trust clients place in its products and services. The unique nature of the government software market, including lengthy sales cycles, stringent compliance requirements, and complex integration needs, prevents new entrants from rapidly establishing a business of comparable scale and depth solely through capital advantage, forming an exceptionally robust moat."
