        "comment_en": "Broadridge plays a pivotal central node role within the financial services ecosystem, exhibiting network effects across multiple dimensions. As a primary platform for proxy voting and investor communications, its increasing adoption by issuers, brokers, and investors significantly enhances industry-wide standardization, efficiency, and data fluidity. This widespread adoption establishes Broadridge's platform as the \"common language\" of the industry, creating greater value for all participants. New entrants find that utilizing Broadridge's services facilitates smoother interactions with other market players, thereby forming a positive feedback loop that solidifies its market leadership and makes it difficult to displace."
