        "comment_en": "KLA possesses a vast and growing patent portfolio covering core semiconductor inspection and metrology technologies, forming a robust technological moat. These patents protect its unique solutions, making it difficult for competitors to replicate them quickly. In the semiconductor industry, technological leadership acts as an implicit entry barrier. KLA's patent cluster ensures its indispensability in critical processes, akin to a franchise, providing a sustained competitive advantage."
