        "comment_en": "KLA's network effect manifests in the data advantage accumulated from its extensive customer base. As more semiconductor manufacturers use KLA equipment, KLA gathers richer process data and defect patterns, which in turn optimizes its algorithms and solutions, enhancing inspection efficiency and accuracy. This data-driven continuous improvement makes KLA's products more attractive to new customers, creating a virtuous cycle. While not a traditional social network model, it represents a critical data network effect within the industrial ecosystem."
