        "comment_zh": "Cadence的管理層在資本配置上表現出審慎與戰略性。公司持續將大量自由現金流（FCF TTM $1,678.7M）投入到核心研發，以維持技術領先地位，並進行戰略性的小型併購以補充技術或人才。同時，在適當時機進行股票回購，有效提升股東價值。其穩健的資產負債表（現金$1,440.4M對總負債$2,482.2M）也顯示了其財務紀律，避免了盲目擴張或高風險投資，符合巴菲特對理性資本配置的期望。",
        "comment_en": "Cadence's management demonstrates prudent and strategic capital allocation. The company consistently deploys substantial free cash flow (FCF TTM $1,678.7M) into core R&D to maintain technological leadership, and executes strategic, smaller acquisitions to augment technology or talent. Concurrently, share buybacks are conducted opportunistically to enhance shareholder value. Its robust balance sheet ($1,440.4M cash vs. $2,482.2M total liabilities) reflects financial discipline, avoiding reckless expansion or high-risk investments, aligning with Buffett's expectations for rational capital deployment."
