        "comment_zh": "Amphenol的產品是電子系統中不可或缺的基礎元件，對技術變革和AI顛覆具有強大免疫力。無論技術如何演進，對可靠、高效物理連接的需求始終存在。公司持續投入研發，確保其產品始終處於技術前沿，滿足客戶不斷升級的需求。其多元化的終端市場（汽車、通訊、工業、軍工等）也分散了單一行業波動的風險，使其需求確定性極高，展現出極強的業務韌性與抗顛覆能力。",
        "comment_en": "Amphenol's products are indispensable foundational components in electronic systems, exhibiting strong immunity to technological shifts and AI disruption. Regardless of technological evolution, the fundamental need for reliable, high-performance physical connections persists. The company continuously invests in R&D, ensuring its products remain at the technological forefront to meet evolving customer demands. Its diversified end markets (automotive, communications, industrial, military, etc.) also mitigate risks from single-industry fluctuations, ensuring high demand certainty and demonstrating robust business resilience against disruption."
