      "m1_brand_pricing": {
        "score": 7,
        "comment_zh": "TE Connectivity 作為關鍵連接與傳感解決方案的全球領導者，在工業、汽車、通訊等B2B領域建立了強大的品牌信譽。其產品的可靠性、高性能及在客戶系統中的深度整合，使得客戶在選擇供應商時，更看重產品品質與長期穩定性而非單純價格。這賦予了公司在特定高價值、高技術門檻產品上一定的定價權，尤其是在客戶對產品故障容忍度極低的應用場景中，其品牌代表著品質保證，使其能夠在不顯著流失客戶的情況下，轉嫁部分成本壓力並維持合理利潤。",
        "comment_en": "As a global leader in critical connectivity and sensor solutions, TE Connectivity has built a strong brand reputation in B2B sectors like industrial, automotive, and communications. The reliability, high performance, and deep integration of its products within customer systems mean clients prioritize quality and long-term stability over mere price. This grants the company a degree of pricing power for specific high-value, high-tech barrier products. Especially in applications where product failure tolerance is extremely low, its brand signifies quality assurance, allowing it to pass on some cost pressures and maintain healthy margins without significant customer attrition."
      },
