        "comment_en": "TE Connectivity's business model primarily revolves around B2B component supply, so its network effects are not as direct or pronounced as those of social platforms. However, as its connector and sensor solutions are adopted by an increasing number of industry leaders, particularly in the development and promotion of emerging technology standards (e.g., 5G, electric vehicles), TE's products often become de facto industry standards or preferred solutions. This attracts more upstream and downstream manufacturers to develop based on its technology, forming an indirect ecosystem around TE's technology, making its solutions more attractive to new customers and thus generating some positive feedback effects."
