        "score": 8,
        "comment_zh": "希爾頓作為全球頂級酒店品牌之一，擁有極高的品牌認知度和客戶忠誠度。其多元化的品牌組合，從奢華的華爾道夫到中端的希爾頓花園酒店，使其能精準服務不同客群。強大的品牌心智讓希爾頓在關鍵市場和高端服務領域具備顯著的定價權，即使在經濟波動時，其核心商務和高端休閒客戶仍願意為其品質和服務支付溢價。這使其能有效轉嫁成本，並維持健康的利潤率，是典型的品牌護城河。",
        "comment_en": "Hilton, as a premier global hotel brand, boasts exceptional brand recognition and customer loyalty. Its diverse portfolio, ranging from luxury Waldorf Astoria to mid-tier Hilton Garden Inn, allows it to cater precisely to various customer segments. This strong brand mindshare grants Hilton significant pricing power in key markets and premium service sectors. Even during economic fluctuations, its core business and high-end leisure clients are willing to pay a premium for its quality and service. This enables effective cost pass-through and maintenance of healthy profit margins, exemplifying a robust brand moat."
