        "comment_zh": "摩根大通持續展現出卓越的資本配置效率，其17.4%的股東權益報酬率（ROE）遠超行業平均水平，並持續高於其加權平均資本成本（WACC），這證明了其管理層在風險控制、成本管理和業務拓展方面的卓越能力。這種長週期超額回報的韌性，是其強大護城河的直接體現，表明公司能夠持續為股東創造價值，而非僅僅是資本的商品化運用。",
        "comment_en": "JPMorgan Chase consistently demonstrates superior capital allocation efficiency, with a 17.4% Return on Equity (ROE) significantly above industry averages and persistently exceeding its Weighted Average Cost of Capital (WACC). This attests to management's exceptional capabilities in risk control, cost management, and business expansion. Such long-term resilience in generating excess returns is a direct manifestation of its strong moat, indicating the company's ability to continuously create shareholder value beyond mere commoditized capital deployment."
