        "comment_zh": "摩根大通的客戶保留能力極強，這得益於其廣泛的產品線和服務深度。無論是個人儲蓄、貸款、信用卡，還是企業的現金管理、投資銀行、資產管理，客戶一旦與摩根大通建立關係，往往會因為便利性、信任和服務質量而長期留存。這種高客戶保留率不僅降低了獲客成本，也為公司提供了穩定的收入流和交叉銷售機會，是其護城河的重要組成部分。",
        "comment_en": "JPMorgan Chase exhibits strong customer retention, attributed to its extensive product lines and service depth. Whether for individual savings, loans, credit cards, or corporate cash management, investment banking, and asset management, once clients establish a relationship with JPM, they tend to remain long-term due to convenience, trust, and service quality. This high retention rate not only reduces customer acquisition costs but also provides the company with stable revenue streams and cross-selling opportunities, forming a crucial part of its moat."
