        "comment_zh": "CME Group作為全球領先的衍生品交易所，其品牌在金融市場中具有無可比擬的權威性和信任度。它為利率、股指、能源等關鍵資產類別提供核心的價格發現和風險管理平台。這種市場主導地位賦予CME強大的定價權，使其能夠在不顯著影響交易量的前提下，調整其交易和清算費用。客戶對其流動性和市場完整性的依賴，使得CME的服務成為不可或缺的基礎設施，遠超一般商品型企業，展現出特許經營般的定價能力。",
        "comment_en": "CME Group, as a leading global derivatives exchange, possesses unparalleled brand authority and trust within financial markets. It provides core price discovery and risk management platforms for critical asset classes like interest rates, equity indices, and energy. This dominant market position grants CME significant pricing power, allowing it to adjust its trading and clearing fees without materially impacting trading volumes. Clients' reliance on its liquidity and market integrity makes CME's services indispensable infrastructure, far surpassing that of a commodity business, demonstrating franchise-like pricing ability."
