        "comment_zh": "大型企業保險經紀和風險諮詢市場並非傳統意義上的利基市場，但由於其所需的複雜性、信任度和規模，市場高度集中於少數全球參與者手中。新進入者若想獲得市場份額，將面臨巨大的投資和漫長的信譽建立過程。Marsh McLennan等現有巨頭在這種寡頭壟斷環境中，競爭更側重於價值而非價格，形成天然的理性寡占。",
        "comment_en": "The market for large-scale corporate insurance brokerage and risk consulting is not a niche market in the traditional sense, but it is highly concentrated among a few global players due to the complexity, trust, and scale required. New entrants would face immense investment and a lengthy process to build credibility to gain market share. Existing giants like Marsh McLennan operate in an oligopolistic environment where competition focuses more on value than price, forming a natural rational oligopoly."
