        "comment_zh": "Marsh McLennan的ROE高達26.2%，ROA為6.7%，這些數據強烈表明其卓越的盈利能力。作為一個資產輕型服務企業，高ROE和ROA通常意味著健康的投入資本回報率（ROIC）。公司每年產生47.67億美元的自由現金流，證明其資本部署效率高，並能持續創造超越加權平均資本成本的回報，為股東帶來實質性的複利增長。",
        "comment_en": "Marsh McLennan's impressive ROE of 26.2% and ROA of 6.7% strongly indicate superior profitability. For an asset-light service business, high ROE and ROA typically translate to a healthy Return on Invested Capital (ROIC). The company generates $4.767 billion in free cash flow annually, demonstrating efficient capital deployment and a sustained ability to generate returns well above its weighted average cost of capital, compounding shareholder value effectively."
