        "comment_en": "The nature of Marsh McLennan's services dictates exceptionally high customer retention. Large corporations have complex and ongoing risk management and insurance needs, requiring long-term, trusted partnerships. Once a relationship is established, clients typically rely on their expert advice and services for extended periods. This high customer stickiness not only reduces acquisition costs but also provides stable and predictable recurring revenue, granting the company strong immunity to market fluctuations and technological shifts."
