        "comment_zh": "U.S. Bancorp 在其核心運營區域，特別是美國中西部和西部地區，建立了強大的市場地位。在這些區域，其市場份額可能達到「有效規模」的程度，即新競爭者進入將面臨巨大的市場滲透挑戰，並可能引發對所有參與者都不利的價格戰。儘管整體銀行業競爭激烈，USB在特定地理區域或細分市場的集中度，使其能夠在這些利基市場中享有相對的寡占優勢，有效阻止了不理性的新競爭。",
        "comment_en": "U.S. Bancorp has established a strong market position in its core operating regions, particularly in the Midwest and Western United States. In these areas, its market share may reach an \"efficient scale,\" meaning new competitors would face significant challenges in market penetration and could trigger price wars detrimental to all participants. Although the overall banking industry is highly competitive, USB's concentration in specific geographic areas or niche markets allows it to enjoy a relative oligopoly advantage in these segments, effectively deterring irrational new competition."
