        "comment_zh": "U.S. Bancorp 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出穩健的策略。其強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM $12,384.0 M）提供了充足的靈活性。作為一家成熟的銀行，USB通常會透過派發股息和股票回購來回報股東，而非盲目進行高溢價併購。在市場低估時積極回購股票，有助於提升每股價值，最大化股東利益。儘管Piotroski F-Score為5/9，顯示仍有改進空間，但整體而言，管理層對風險的審慎態度和對股東回報的重視，構成了一道可靠的護城河。",
        "comment_en": "U.S. Bancorp's management demonstrates a sound strategy in capital allocation. Its robust free cash flow (FCF TTM $12,384.0 M) provides ample flexibility. As a mature bank, USB typically returns capital to shareholders through dividends and share buybacks, rather than pursuing blind, high-premium acquisitions. Actively repurchasing shares when the market is undervalued helps enhance per-share value and maximize shareholder interests. Although the Piotroski F-Score of 5/9 indicates room for improvement, overall, management's prudent approach to risk and commitment to shareholder returns constitute a reliable moat."
