        "comment_en": "Cencora's core strategic assets, namely its vast, efficient, and compliant healthcare distribution network, are incredibly difficult to replicate. Even with a hundred billion dollars, a competitor would struggle to build the same scale of infrastructure, obtain all necessary regulatory approvals, establish trusted relationships with thousands of healthcare institutions, and achieve comparable operational efficiency and market coverage within a few years. This deep operational expertise, complex logistics system, and entrenched customer relationships constitute an extremely high degree of capital irreproducibility, forming one of its most robust moats."
