        "comment_en": "STERIS has cultivated a robust brand reputation in the healthcare equipment sector, particularly in sterilization and infection prevention. Hospitals and medical facilities are highly dependent on its products and services, as they are directly linked to patient safety and regulatory compliance. This trust grants STERIS significant pricing power when delivering critical solutions. Even with price increases, customers find it difficult to switch providers due to high transition costs and substantial potential risks. Its brand signifies reliability and compliance, an invaluable asset in the medical field, forming a strong economic moat."
