        "comment_en": "The medical equipment and sterilization services industry is subject to stringent government regulation, such as FDA approvals in the US. STERIS possesses a substantial patent portfolio and deep expertise in regulatory compliance within this domain. These patents not only safeguard its core technologies but, more critically, obtaining and maintaining regulatory approvals for these essential products constitutes an exceptionally high barrier to entry. New competitors would need to invest immense capital and time to navigate rigorous testing and approval processes, thereby creating a protected market position for STERIS, shielding it from direct threats by new entrants."
