        "comment_en": "For hospitals and healthcare systems, switching sterilization equipment or service providers entails substantial transition costs. This involves not only the procurement and installation of new equipment but also staff training, process revalidation, system integration, and the risk of operational disruption. In a medical environment, any disruption could jeopardize patient safety, making healthcare institutions highly reluctant to undertake such risks. STERIS's products and services are deeply embedded in its customers' daily operational workflows, resulting in extremely high customer stickiness, ensuring stable recurring revenue and robust customer loyalty."
