        "comment_zh": "Veeva的產品具備極高的轉換成本。其軟體深入整合到藥廠的研發、臨床試驗、法規提交和商業運營等核心流程中。更換系統不僅涉及龐大的數據遷移、員工再培訓，更可能導致關鍵業務流程中斷，帶來巨大的財務損失和運營風險。這種深度嵌入性使得客戶一旦採用Veeva，便難以脫離，為公司創造了極其穩固的客戶基礎和持續的收入流。",
        "comment_en": "Veeva's products possess exceptionally high switching costs. Its software is deeply integrated into the core processes of pharmaceutical companies, including R&D, clinical trials, regulatory submissions, and commercial operations. Replacing the system involves not only massive data migration and employee retraining but also potential disruptions to critical business processes, leading to significant financial losses and operational risks. This deep embeddedness makes it extremely difficult for customers to leave Veeva once adopted, creating a highly stable customer base and recurring revenue streams for the company."
