        "comment_en": "Veeva demonstrates strong network effects within the life sciences sector. As more pharmaceutical companies adopt its platform, Veeva becomes an industry standard, facilitating collaboration in areas like clinical trial data sharing and regulatory submission. This standardization effect reduces friction costs across the ecosystem. Furthermore, a large user base attracts more developers to build applications on its platform and provides more data to optimize its AI/ML capabilities, further enhancing the platform's value and stickiness."
