        "comment_zh": "作為領先的SaaS供應商，Veeva享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。一旦軟體開發完成，服務額外客戶的邊際成本極低。其龐大的客戶基礎使其能持續投入巨額資金於研發，不斷提升產品功能和服務質量，而這是小型競爭者難以匹敵的。這種規模效應不僅降低了單位成本，也加速了產品迭代，鞏固了其市場領導地位。",
        "comment_en": "As a leading SaaS provider, Veeva enjoys significant economies of scale. Once the software is developed, the marginal cost of serving additional customers is extremely low. Its vast customer base allows it to continuously invest substantial capital in R&D, constantly enhancing product features and service quality, which smaller competitors cannot match. This scale effect not only reduces unit costs but also accelerates product iteration, solidifying its market leadership."
