        "comment_en": "Veeva's moat is not geographical, but rather a 'niche market oligopoly' formed within the highly specialized life sciences cloud software market. This market is large enough to be profitable, yet the deep industry knowledge and specialized technical barriers required are extremely high, deterring generalist software companies. Leveraging years of accumulated industry expertise and customer trust, Veeva has established an unshakeable leadership position in this specific domain, creating a natural rational oligopoly."
