        "comment_zh": "Veeva的客戶保留率極高，這得益於其產品的深度整合性與不可或缺性。生命科學公司一旦將Veeva的解決方案嵌入其核心業務流程，轉換成本（M3）便成為強大的黏性因素。此外，Veeva持續創新並提供符合行業最新法規的功能，確保客戶能長期依賴其平台。這種高保留率不僅帶來穩定的經常性收入，也證明了其解決方案的持續價值和客戶滿意度。",
        "comment_en": "Veeva boasts extremely high customer retention, a testament to its products' deep integration and indispensability. Once life sciences companies embed Veeva's solutions into their core business processes, the switching costs (M3) become a powerful sticky factor. Furthermore, Veeva continuously innovates and provides features compliant with the latest industry regulations, ensuring clients can rely on its platform long-term. This high retention rate not only generates stable recurring revenue but also proves the sustained value and customer satisfaction of its solutions."
