        "comment_en": "Veeva's moat exhibits extremely strong capital irreproducibility and disruption immunity. Even with hundreds of billions of dollars, competitors would struggle to replicate in a short period the deep industry knowledge, customer trust, regulatory compliance, and highly integrated product ecosystem Veeva has accumulated in the life sciences sector. The life sciences industry's demand for precision, compliance, and efficiency is enduring. Veeva continuously integrates new technologies like AI into its platform, rather than being disrupted by them, ensuring the long-term resilience of its business model."
