        "comment_en": "Even with a hundred billion dollars, a competitor could not quickly replicate Vertex's deep scientific accumulation, patent portfolio, clinical data, regulatory relationships, and trust among physicians and patients in the cystic fibrosis field. These intangible assets are the result of decades of R&D investment, countless trial failures, and successes. Its unique drug discovery platform and profound understanding of specific disease mechanisms constitute an extremely high knowledge barrier. This irreproducibility is one of its most robust moats, ensuring its long-term competitive advantage."
