        "comment_zh": "電梯作為現代建築中不可或缺的垂直交通工具，其基本需求具有極高的確定性和持久性。儘管行業技術不斷演進，如智能電梯、預測性維護等，但這些創新更傾向於由奧的斯等行業巨頭整合和引領，而非顛覆其核心業務。由於電梯涉及嚴格的安全標準和法規，新技術的採用需要漫長的驗證過程，這使得奧的斯對潛在的技術變革或AI顛覆具備強大的免疫力，需求穩定。",
        "comment_en": "As an indispensable vertical transportation system in modern buildings, the fundamental demand for elevators is highly certain and durable. While industry technology continuously evolves, with innovations like smart elevators and predictive maintenance, these advancements are more likely to be integrated and led by industry giants like Otis rather than disrupting their core business. Due to stringent safety standards and regulations, the adoption of new technologies requires a lengthy validation process, granting Otis strong immunity to potential technological shifts or AI disruption, ensuring stable demand."
