        "comment_en": "Graco's industrial equipment is often deeply integrated into customers' production processes, making switching suppliers entail significant costs. These include not only the financial outlay for new equipment but also employee training, system compatibility adjustments, potential production downtime risks, and uncertainty about a new supplier's reliability. For industrial clients relying on this equipment for production efficiency, switching costs far outweigh any price difference in the equipment itself. This high switching cost creates a robust moat, locking in customers and ensuring stable recurring revenue."
